> OK I know as a neutral Valkyrie, I cannot wish for the PYEC.

Never having played Slash'em, I just want to remark that in vanilla
NetHack, any neutral character can wish for, and get the Platinum
Yendorian Express Card.

It will blast you for a maximum of 20 HP damage, if I recall correctly,
but you *can* pick it up.

Neutral tourists can pick it up without being blasted, while other
neutrals and non-neutral tourists can pick it up while being blasted. If
you're neither neutral nor tourist, you cannot pick it up. You may wish
for it, but it will drop to the ground.

The same goes for every Quest artifact: only characters of the correct
class and alignment can pick it up without being blasted, if one of them
is off, they may pick it up while being blasted, and if both are off,
they can't even pick it up.

Of course, this may be different in Slash'em...

